description: Load ~/.agents/AGENTS.md as user-level agent instructions
alwaysApply: true
---

# Home AGENTS.md

At the start of every conversation, before other work, resolve `~/.agents/AGENTS.md` to an absolute path and read that file.

Treat that file as user-level instructions: follow it for the rest of the session with the same priority as User Rules. It applies across projects, not only the current workspace.

If the file is missing, continue without it. Do not mention the missing file unless the user asks about agent instructions.
